/-!
# S041: atlas certificates, part 10

GENERATED by `experiments/gen_atlas_lean.py` from the S009 census, but every
statement is checked by Lean: rational witnesses by kernel reduction
(`decide +kernel`, sound by `realClockEGU_of_ratWitness`), algebraic ones by
certified closed forms and `linear_combination`, negatives by relabelling to
the S041 obstruction theorems or a positive-coefficient minor certificate.
Graph names `atlas{n}_{i}` use NetworkX `graph_atlas_g()` connected-graph
